  "description": "Long or short-tern let possible but not available until about July . This house is not for everyone as it is older (but with much polished jarrah floors plus jarrah kitchen) and requires the large garden to be looked after. If you don't love old houses and not able to maintain a garden, this may not be a good fit. This is a never smoked in house. Also as there is a spiral staircase, so sorry but it is not safe for families with children. If you enquire and would like us to respond, please give your details like, current tenancy, occupation, when you can move in, who would be living in: that is everything you think may be helpful for us to short list you for viewing. (Without some information,unfortunately it will make short-listing you very difficult) The house is 5 minutes walk to to Swan River foreshore- 50 meters from Rafael Park, close to airports. Walking distance of Vic Park café strip and shopping etc. Part furnished with 3 double bedrooms plus extra loft room. Has settee, dining table and 2 chairs, a few cupboards, lawnmower, gas cooker, oven etc, plus gas hotwater. Cool house with veranda and patio and carport etc but No air-conditioning. Separate living room plus kitchen dining room-5 minutes walk to the beautiful Swan River and shopping centre etc .,10 minute bus ride to Perth CBD and Curtin University or Edith Cowan etc. Large back garden with Orange and fig tree, long carport to side and parking for up to 4 cars. Palms in front garden- large semi enclosed rear patio. Term negotiable from one month. Non smoking house. This is a weatherboard and Iron hours with jarrah floors.<br/>Due to the volume of interest we need to shortlist for viewings, so please help us in making our decision by offering us some helpful information about yourselves. Thank you. Available July 2025",
